  - `09_collab/reports/T37_report.md`, `09_collab/logs/T37_scratch/**`, and the board line.
- Do not touch:
  - `E1_pilot/runs/` (read-only), `pilot_results/`, `E2_labelling/`, `E5_codemut/`;
  - `conformance.py`, `attribute.py`.
- No Docker, Java, Maven, network or fuzzer execution. Claude runs the runtime smoke.
- Mark inferences with ⚠️. Never print auth values.
